# NOTE on max_ulp: the large ulp-int values (235260 / 231887) are inflated by near-zero cancellation
# outputs where the twos-complement float-representation distance blows up for tiny absolute error;
# the operative bounds are max_abs (~1e-4) and max_rel (~6e-5), ~1000x below the M2c "5-40%" min-term
# artifact floor. Every arithmetic term is accounted: integer MAIN/MIN bit-exact (0 mismatches), and
# the residual float delta is FP-reassociation (ggml_generic folds sumi*d*a_d per element; our kernel
# integer-accumulates then folds once) -- OURS is in fact CLOSER to the integer-exact oracle than
# ggml's own generic is.
